        "original_id": "d9843a1d-d858-5a44-af92-cd329db214c2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Isaiah Mustafa, Terry Crews, Stacy Keibler, Mark Fitzloff\n- Campaigns: Make a Smellmitment\n- TV Episodes: Chuck Versus the A-Team\n- Companies/Brands: Wieden+Kennedy, Nike, Coca-Cola, Procter & Gamble, Old Spice\n\nFacts:\n- Isaiah Amir Mustafa was born on February 11, 1974, and he is an American actor and former NFL practice squad wide receiver.\n- Mark Fitzloff is known for his work at Wieden+Kennedy on Nike and Coca-Cola.\n- Mark Fitzloff is also known for reviving Procter & Gamble's Old Spice brand.\n- The \"Make a Smellmitment\" campaign retains much of the format from the previous campaign, including characters played by Isaiah Mustafa and Terry Crews.\n- In the TV episode \"Chuck Versus the A-Team,\" Chuck fears that new CIA operatives played by Isaiah Mustafa and Stacy Keibler, who have downloaded the Intersect, will render him obsolete.",
